{"root":"sombong","ipa":"/somboŋ/","core":"形容一个人自视甚高、傲慢无礼，认为自己比别人优越。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/somboŋ/","zh":"傲慢的，自大的","phrases":[{"t":"sangat sombong","zh":"非常傲慢"},{"t":"sikap sombong","zh":"傲慢的态度"},{"t":"jangan sombong","zh":"不要自大"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia menjadi sombong setelah kaya.","zh":"他变富有了之后变得很傲慢。"},{"t":"Janganlah sombong dengan kepintaranmu.","zh":"不要因为你的聪明而自大。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"sombong","ipa":"/somboŋ/","zh":"傲慢的","phrase":{"t":"orang sombong","zh":"傲慢的人"},"example":{"t":"Dia dikenal sebagai orang yang sombong.","zh":"他被认为是一个傲慢的人。"}},{"w":"kesombongan","ipa":"/kəsomboŋan/","zh":"傲慢，自负","phrase":{"t":"kesombongan diri","zh":"个人的自负"},"example":{"t":"Kesombongan akan membawa kehancuran.","zh":"傲慢会导致毁灭。"}},{"w":"menyombongkan","ipa":"/məɲomboŋkan/","zh":"炫耀，夸耀","phrase":{"t":"menyombongkan diri","zh":"炫耀自己"},"example":{"t":"Dia suka menyombongkan kekayaannya.","zh":"他喜欢炫耀他的财富。"}}],"derSlugs":["sombong","kesombongan","menyombongkan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-27T16:43:58.636Z","src":"base"}